      "writtenOn": "2026-06-26T20:35:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I figured it out. The issue is that ANGLE has never actually rolled `android_ndk_version`. It was added only recently, and it hasn\u0027t changed since then: https://crrev.com/c/7800061\n\nThe script doesn\u0027t attempt to setdep if the version number hasn\u0027t changed. When I tested it locally I manually set it to a lower number so I could look at the diff to make sure it would successfully update. Doing the same thing in ANGLE, the script fails in the same way.\n\nFiled https://crbug.com/528413044. It\u0027s P3 for Dawn, but ANGLE will eventually run into this if it\u0027s not fixed.",
